---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contatti"
  description="Contatta RM-Solution di Marco Regalia per una conversazione esplorativa. Telefono, email, form di contatto. Sede a Gallarate (VA), interventi in tutta Italia."
>
  <section class="contact-page">
    <div class="container contact-grid">
      <div class="contact-intro">
        <span class="section-num">— Contatti</span>
        <h1>Prima di un contratto, <span class="accent">una conversazione.</span></h1>
        <p class="contact-lede">
          Trenta minuti, senza impegno. Mi racconti la situazione, ti dico onestamente
          se posso esserti utile e in che forma. Se non lo sono, ti indico chi può.
        </p>

        <div class="contact-info">
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Email</span>
            <a href="mailto:info@rm-solution.it">info@rm-solution.it</a>
          </div>
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Telefono</span>
            <a href="tel:+393475400385">+39 347 540 0385</a>
          </div>
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Sede</span>
            <span>21013 Gallarate (VA)</span>
          </div>
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">Operatività</span>
            <span>Lombardia · remoto in tutta Italia</span>
          </div>
          <div class="info-row">
            <span class="info-label">LinkedIn</span>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/marcoregalia" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
              /in/marcoregalia ↗
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-form-box">
        <div class="form-eyebrow">— Form di contatto</div>
        <form
          class="contact-form"
          action="https://formspree.io/f/YOUR_FORM_ID"
          method="POST"
          id="contact-form"
        >
          <div class="form-field">
            <label class="form-label" for="name">Nome e cognome</label>
            <input class="form-input" type="text" id="name" name="name" required autocomplete="name" />
          </div>

          <div class="form-field">
            <label class="form-label" for="company">Azienda / Studio</label>
            <input class="form-input" type="text" id="company" name="company" autocomplete="organization" />
          </div>

          <div class="form-field">
            <label class="form-label" for="email">Email</label>
            <input class="form-input" type="email" id="email" name="email" required autocomplete="email" />
          </div>

          <div class="form-field">
            <label class="form-label" for="role">Ruolo</label>
            <input class="form-input" type="text" id="role" name="role" placeholder="Titolare, IT manager, fondatore..." />
          </div>

          <div class="form-field">
            <label class="form-label" for="message">Di cosa parliamo?</label>
            <textarea
              class="form-textarea"
              id="message"
              name="message"
              required
              placeholder="Una breve descrizione della situazione: cosa cerchi, cosa non funziona oggi, cosa vorresti ottenere."
            ></textarea>
          </div>

          <div class="form-privacy">
            <label class="checkbox">
              <input type="checkbox" required />
              <span>
                Ho letto la <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> e acconsento al
                trattamento dei dati per essere ricontattato.
              </span>
            </label>
          </div>

          <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary form-submit">Invia richiesta</button>

          <p class="form-note">
            Ti risponderò entro un giorno lavorativo. Se l'argomento non rientra
            nelle mie competenze, te lo dirò subito senza farti perdere tempo.
          </p>
        </form>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .contact-page {
    padding-top: clamp(48px, 8vw, 96px);
    padding-bottom: clamp(64px, 10vw, 128px);
  }
  .contact-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 64px;
  }
  .contact-intro h1 {
    font-size: clamp(32px, 5vw, 48px);
    line-height: 1.05;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    margin-top: 8px;
  }
  .contact-lede {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .contact-info {
    border-top: 0.5px solid var(--rule);
  }
  .info-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: baseline;
    padding: 16px 0;
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--rule);
    font-size: 14px;
    gap: 16px;
  }
  .info-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .info-row a, .info-row span:not(.info-label) {
    color: var(--text);
    text-align: right;
  }
  .info-row a {
    border-bottom: 0.5px solid var(--rule-strong);
  }
  .info-row a:hover { border-bottom-color: var(--blue); color: var(--blue-deep); }

  .contact-form-box {
    background: var(--bg-soft);
    border: 0.5px solid var(--rule);
    padding: 32px;
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  .form-eyebrow {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--blue-deep);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .form-privacy {
    margin: 24px 0;
  }
  .checkbox {
    display: flex;
    gap: 10px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-soft);
    line-height: 1.5;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  .checkbox input {
    margin-top: 3px;
    accent-color: var(--blue);
  }
  .checkbox a {
    color: var(--blue-deep);
    text-decoration: underline;
  }
  .form-submit {
    width: 100%;
  }
  .form-note {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-top: 16px;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .contact-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 48px;
    }
  }
</style>

<script>
  const form = document.getElementById('contact-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
  form?.addEventListener('submit', (e) => {
    if (!form.action.includes('YOUR_FORM_ID')) return;
    e.preventDefault();
    alert('Configura il tuo Form ID di Formspree nel campo action del form.');
  });
</script>
